    "what_it_does": "Reliance Industries operates across energy, petrochemicals, retail, and digital services. Its energy and O2C segment produces and sells transportation fuels, polymers, and intermediates globally, while its retail segment (Reliance Retail) sells consumer electronics, fashion, and FMCG products to Indian consumers through a large network of stores and digital channels. Jio provides telecom and digital services to hundreds of millions of subscribers.",
